        "id": 1002609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2010-06-30T19:32:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, I\u0027d rather not add the prefixLength parameter.  Applications should not have the ability to set network routes.  In fact this API will be deprecated when we have better methods for binding requests to interfaces.\n\nPlease do drop the addressType.",
